# Bug report

## Describe the bug

Eslint does not lint any pages (eg. `pages/index.js`) when in dev mode (though somehow it lints `pages/_app.js` so it's at least partially working).

When running `next build` however, Eslint properly lints all pages. So the problem is only in dev/watch mode (`next`)

## To Reproduce

