this is just Next.js trying to SSR your web component. 


## Fix

Instead of  

```js
import "wc-spinners/dist/half-circle-spinner.js"
```

do 

```js
function Component() {

  React.useEffect(() => {
    import("wc-spinners/dist/half-circle-spinner.js");
  });
  // etc
	return <div>
		// etc
		<half-circle-spinner />
